# Format: <sha256>  <real-relative-path-from-repo-root>
#
# A human maintainer runs, for each entry below whose staged file exists
# under this human-copy/ directory: `cp human-copy/<path> <path>` then
# verifies the copied file's SHA-256 against the hash recorded here.
