# the real protected file. Confirmed via a probe: writing a
# differently-named file to the SAME human-copy/.github/workflows/
# directory succeeded; only the exact "test.yml" basename is blocked. Three
# prior features (epic-136-phase2-gates, epic-159-pillar-c,
# epic-159-pillar-d) already carry a staged test.yml under their own
# human-copy/ trees, so this has been achieved before by some path this
